   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-p-h3-image, with only the changes needed for this test. The vendor's W4A8 DiT and text encoder beside the INT8 ConvRot VAE, the vendor's smallest set, with the upsampler switched off. The DiT stores 4-bit weights in grouped asym_w4a8_int8 layers and keeps its most sensitive layers int8_tensorwise; it reads as w4a8, which FSDP refuses."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | p-h3-image W4A8"
